// Thousand Spires: one against one in sandstone karst country in autumn,
// after Wulingyuan. A lake in the middle, pillars standing out of it, ringed
// by a massif of sandstone blocks and columns with a gate down to the lake
// from each player's tableland; a valley with a river and an estuary east
// and west between the two; benches stepping down to the sea. The woods red
// and gold, a little mist lying in the valleys. A clear morning, so the
// ground reads from the strategic view; skirmish set-up can override the
// weather and the time of day.
(
    biome: Autumn,
    style: Duel,
    weather: Clear,
    tweaks: (mist: 0.3, rain: 0.3),
    time: Morning,
    climate: Autumn,
